Package: RhyME
Title: Beta Regression Cosinor Models for Circadian Methylation Analysis
Version: 0.99.3
Authors@R: person("Yixiang", "Hong", email = "yixiang.hong@uth.tmc.edu",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Fits beta cosinor models to methylation measurements
    using penalized quasi-likelihood (PQL), an optional subject random intercept,
    adjustment covariates, and an optional empirical Bayes (EB) prior on log precision. Tests
    rhythmicity with a null-model score test and estimates rhythm
    parameters from a separate full-model fit.
License: GPL (>= 3)
URL: https://github.com/njuelsdke/RhyME
